    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "When the object finishes validating and reports all warnings, it invokes the callback once with a value of `nil` for its warning parameter.",
      "ko": "By default, this value contains the array of devices that the [`supportedFallbackPrimaryConstituentDevices`](avcapturedevice/supportedfallbackprimaryconstituentdevices.md) property provides.",
      "sourceHash": "aa17808c702e5501c4003dce6624f845e241b9fb31d98e5d0d6368162272616c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "When this occurs, the validator’s [`status`](avcaptionconversionvalidator/status-swift.property.md) value changes to [`AVCaptionConversionValidator.Status.completed`](avcaptionconversionvalidator/status-swift.enum/completed.md).",
      "ko": "이때 검증기의 [`status`](avcaptionconversionvalidator/status-swift.property.md) 값은 [`AVCaptionConversionValidator.Status.completed`](avcaptionconversionvalidator/status-swift.enum/completed.md)로 변경됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "74db9a30fef38e635cfbb484a19d43f95d6b96f55d2450949457be66faa3dabd",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Stop an in-progress validation operation by calling [`stopValidating()`](avcaptionconversionvalidator/stopvalidating().md).",
      "ko": "진행 중인 유효성 검사 작업을 중지하려면 [`stopValidating()`](avcaptionconversionvalidator/stopvalidating().md)을 호출합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "12a5cf53e4ab9806d8266b7c77fbb2da539c229da55f27a06db1dd92b2e4a6be",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: It’s only valid to call this method when the validator’s state is [`AVCaptionConversionValidator.Status.unknown`](avcaptionconversionvalidator/status-swift.enum/unknown.md).",
      "ko": "❗ **중요**: 검증기의 상태가 [`AVCaptionConversionValidator.Status.unknown`](avcaptionconversionvalidator/status-swift.enum/unknown.md)일 때만 이 메서드를 호출할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "84b26061e6db1ba6d6cae96d00b3b6491c2831a7c3986adac53417a6aea1ba66",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
